OL,3,GNEWSAForensic investigation into Omagh
OL,4,Abombing was 'efficient', inquiry hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA forensic science expert has told the
OL,7,FOmagh Bombing Inquiry that the forensic
OL,8,Finvestigation into the bombing was
OL,9,F"efficient".
OL,11,FProfessor Angela Gallop told the
OL,12,Fhearing that the scientific
OL,13,Finvestigation into that scale of
OL,14,Fbombing is "extremely complex".
OL,16,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,17,Fpregnant with twins, died in the
OL,18,Fbombing in the County Tyrone town on 15
OL,19,FAugust 1998 - the biggest single
OL,20,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
