OL,3,GNEWSAForensic investigation into Omagh
OL,4,Abombing was 'efficient', inquiry hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bombing came less than three months
OL,7,Fafter the people of Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fhad voted yes to the Good Friday
OL,9,FAgreement.
